    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk... i dont really want to talk to a therapist about it. it doesnt change the fact that the house is getting darker. it feels like it's just inevitable, you know? like, if the lights are gonna go out anyway, why struggle to keep them on? it's exhausting trying to hold onto things that aren't even there anymore.",
